rnal Sentinel</figure><aside aria-label=advertisement class="gnt_x__c gnt_x__lbl gnt_x__ifg"><div data-g-r=lazy data-gl-method=llx id=~ad-slot-7103-wi-milwaukee-C1258-inline_flex_gallery-sports-basketball-nba-25-ac23 data-x-c=23 class="gnt_x_sl gnt_x_if gnt_x_ifg"></div></aside><figure class="gnt_em gnt_em_img"><picture class=gnt_em_img_pt style=height:660px><img class=gnt_em_img_i src="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/02/05/PMJS/88527695007-mjs-bucks-24-18-jpg-bucks-24.jpg?width=322&height=660&fit=crop&format=pjpg&auto=webp" srcset="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/02/05/PMJS/88527695007-mjs-bucks-24-18-jpg-bucks-24.jpg?width=644&height=1320&fit=crop&format=pjpg&auto=webp 2x" loading=lazy decoding=async alt="Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) talks with head coach Mike Budenholzer during the first half of their Eastern Conference finals game against the Atlanta Hawks Wednesday, June 23, 2021 at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee, Wis."/></picture><div class=gnt_pg_img_cap>Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) talks with head coach Mike Budenholzer during the first half of their Eastern Conference finals game against the Atlanta Hawks Wednesday, June 23, 2021 at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee, Wis.</div>Mark Hoffman, Milwaukee Journal Sentinel</figure><figure class="gnt_em gnt_em_img"><picture class=gnt_em_img_pt style=height:441px><img class=gnt_em_img_i src="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/02/05/PMJS/88527783007-gan-20210629-ggw-ad-1-180.JPG?width=660&height=441&fit=crop&format=pjpg&auto=webp" srcset="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/02/05/PMJS/88527783007-gan-20210629-ggw-ad-1-180.JPG?width=1320&height=882&fit=crop&format=pjpg&auto=webp 2x" loading=lazy decoding=async alt="Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) and Atlanta Hawks center Clint Capela (15) fall to the floor as Antetokounmpo (34) is injured on the play in the third quarter during Game 4 of the Eastern Conference Finals for the 2021 NBA playoffs at State Farm Arena on June 29, 2021."/></picture><div class=gnt_pg_img_cap>Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) and Atlanta Hawks center Clint Capela (15) fall to the floor as Antetokounmpo (34) is injured on the play in the third quarter during Game 4 of the Eastern Conference Finals for the 2021 NBA playoffs at State Farm Arena on June 29, 2021.</div>Brett Davis, USA TODAY Sports</figure><aside aria-label=advertisement class="gnt_x__c gnt_x__lbl gnt_x__ifg"><div data-g-r=lazy data-gl-method=llx id=~ad-slot-7103-wi-milwaukee-C1258-inline_flex_gallery-sports-basketball-nba-26-ac24 data-x-c=24 class="gnt_x_sl gnt_x_if gnt_x_ifg"></div></aside><figure class="gnt_em gnt_em_img"><picture class=gnt_em_img_pt style=height:472px><img class=gnt_em_img_i src="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/02/05/PMJS/88527685007-gan-20210619-gma-cc-1-0953.jpg?width=660&height=472&fit=crop&format=pjpg&auto=webp" srcset="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/02/05/PMJS/88527685007-gan-20210619-gma-cc-1-0953.jpg?width=1320&height=944&fit=crop&format=pjpg&auto=webp 2x" loading=lazy decoding=async alt="Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) puts up a one handed jump shot over Brooklyn Nets forward Blake Griffin (2) in the second quarter during Game 7 in the second round of the 2021 NBA playoffs at Barclays Center on June 19, 2021."/></picture><div class=gnt_pg_img_cap>Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) puts up a one handed jump shot over Brooklyn Nets forward Blake Griffin (2) in the second quarter during Game 7 in the second round of the 2021 NBA playoffs at Barclays Center on June 19, 2021.</div>Wendell Cruz, USA TODAY Sports</figure><figure class="gnt_em gnt_em_img"><picture class=gnt_em_img_pt style=height:571px><img class=gnt_em_img_i src="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/02/05/PMJS/88527767007-mjs-nba-finals-game-2-45.jpg?width=660&height=571&fit=crop&format=pjpg&auto=webp" srcset="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2026/02/05/PMJS/88527767007-mjs-nba-finals-game-2-45.jpg?width=1320&height=1142&fit=crop&format=pjpg&auto=webp 2x" loading=laz